<h1>About University Cafeteria</h1>

<p>
    University Cafeteria Supply Request Management System
    helps cafeteria employees manage their supply requests.
</p>

<h2>System Features</h2>

<ul>
    <li>Add multiple products to a supply request.</li>
    <li>Calculate product costs and request totals.</li>
    <li>Apply preparation fees and discounts.</li>
    <li>Save preferred priority using Cookies.</li>
    <li>Review and confirm supply requests.</li>
    <li>View confirmed requests.</li>
</ul>